PARAMETERS rb_not RADIOBUTTON GROUP g1 DEFAULT 'X' USER-COMMAND rb_cmd.
SELECT-OPTIONS s_not FOR qmel-qmnum MODIF ID not.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP.

PARAMETERS rb_mo  RADIOBUTTON GROUP g1.
SELECT-OPTIONS s_mo FOR aufk-aufnr MODIF ID mo.


AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT.

